{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Fibonacci sequence", ALGOL 68 solution fibonacci-sequence-3.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Fibonacci_sequence#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/fibonacci-sequence-3.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
proc recursive_fibonacci = (int n)int:
  ( n < 2 | n | fib(n-1) + fib(n-2));
)
